neHeight: 1.4 }}>构建产物 + 真实后端 + Edge headless，8 / 8 通过；原型交互无 JS 异常</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>缺陷与回归</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>D-01 本地模拟不兼容真实 DTO、D-02 忽略业务 code、D-03 快照被污染，均已修复回归</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>构建产物</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>mvn package 生成 ftdms-backend-1.0.0.jar（约 54 MB）；Vite 7 前端构建通过</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>验收边界</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>MySQL、HTTPS 与真机 APK 安装 / 图表未执行，列入 M5 / M6 验收边界</Text></Box></Box></Box>
